  data: {
    LLM: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card.\n2. Jokers can be played even if a player HAS the suit led.\n3. Leading a Joker forces all other players to play a Trump card if they have one.',
    Player: '1. Must follow suit. If unable, play any card.\n2. Jokers can be played even if a player HAS the suit led.\n3. Leading a Joker forces all other players to play a Trump card if they have one.',
